      "text": "🚨 TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚨\n\nIn view of the ongoing construction works at Novopan Junction on NH-65, traffic diversions will be in force from 24.05.2026 until completion of the work.\n\nCommuters travelling towards Patancheru and Sangareddy are requested to follow the designated diversion routes and plan their journey accordingly to avoid inconvenience.\n\nWe request citizens to cooperate with Cyberabad Traffic Police and follow traffic advisories for smooth and safe vehicular movement.\n\n#CyberabadTrafficPolice #TrafficAdvisory #NH65 #Patancheru #TrafficDiversion #RoadSafety #TrafficUpdate",
